extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 36: Sovietski printed 127-128 (cache p127-p128, cache page = printed folio + 0 for printed 38-177), a text layer; the manifest lists neither page as welded, corrupt or digit-substituted. Heading Sovietski Citizen O.C.C. (printed 127): a civilian occupation, so occ_group optional and men_of_arms false. Its stat block prints no Attribute Requirements line, and Racial Requirements reads None. || XP: the Sovietski Citizen ladder in the Experience Tables (printed 224, cache p220). || SKILLS: Law (General, Sovietski) is Law; Math: Basic is Mathematics: Basic; Gambling is Gambling (Standard); Breaking/Taming Wild Horses is Breaking/Taming Wild Horse; Pilot: Hovercraft (Ground) is Hover Craft (ground). Hand to Hand prices are Secondary Skills, recorded as costs expert 2 and martial_arts 3, the Sovietski Soldier''s reading of a Secondary Skill price. || PACKAGES: one civilian package in place of O.C.C. Related Skills, as an M.O.S. choice. The Military M.O.S. route (keep the skills of a past military M.O.S.) is not modelled; it is named in the choice''s note. The Clerical package''s +10% to Mathematics: Basic and Law is prose. In a pair printed X or Y (+N%) the bonus is read as both options''; where it is printed beside the first option only, it is that option''s. The Factory package''s W.P. must be modern, a limit the except list cannot state, so it is in the note. || BONUSES: +1 save vs Horror Factor at levels 2, 6 and 10 is at_level. || HEALTHY SUSPICION is a special ability with its own figure, granted through a one-option group. || MONEY: the nest egg is held by two thirds only, so no starting_money; it is in restrictions."
